        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Araya, Marcus Mumford\n- Bands: Slayer, Mumford & Sons\n- Songs: \"Eyes of the Insane\", \"30/30-150\"\n- Awards: 49th Annual Grammy Awards, Best Metal Performance\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Araya was born on June 6, 1961.\n- Tom Araya is a Chilean American musician.\n- Tom Araya is best known as the vocalist and bassist of the American thrash metal band Slayer.\n- Marcus Mumford was born on 31 January 1987.\n- Marcus Mumford is a British-American singer, songwriter, musician, and producer.\n- Marcus Mumford is best known as the lead singer of the band Mumford & Sons.\n- Tom Araya wrote the song \"Eyes of the Insane\" during pre-production for its album.\n- At the 49th Annual Grammy Awards, the song \"30/30-150\" was nominated for Best Metal Performance.\n- At the 49th Annual Grammy Awards, \"30/30-150\" lost Best Metal Performance to \"Eyes of the Insane\" by Slayer.",
